@host = http://localhost:5000
@pingHost = http://localhost:5200

### 1. GET / : Kiểm tra API đang chạy → 200 OK
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET /api/assignments : Lấy danh sách bài tập → 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. POST /api/assignments/1/submissions : Tạo lượt nộp hợp lệ → 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. GET /api/submissions/{id} : Đọc lại lượt nộp (received -> processing -> graded) → 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thiếu dữ liệu studentCode hoặc repositoryUrl → 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST với assignmentId không tồn tại (999) → 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 7. GET lượt nộp không tồn tại (GUID rỗng) → 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bắt tay SignalR negotiate → 200 OK + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai đường dẫn hub (/hub/ thay vì /hubs/) → 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. Bắt tay negotiate với PingSignalR (port 5200) → 200 OK
POST {{pingHost}}/hubs/ping/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
